WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.385
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with

00:00:05.385 --> 00:00:07.005
Ghanaian and other African artists.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:11.088
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene.

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:16.862
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking. Record why your chosen

00:00:16.862 --> 00:00:18.499
technique suits the message.

00:00:19.367 --> 00:00:22.332
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture.
